{title: 30 Abre mis ojos}
{key: D}
{time: 3/4}
{lyricist: Robert Cull (1949- ); Vers. esp.: Rubén L. Duré (1944-}
{composer: Robert Cull (1949- )}

{sov}
[D]Abre mis [A7][G][A7sus4]ojos, [A]Jesús, [G]quie[D][F#7][Bm]ro verte,
[D]conmigo [G]te[Em][A]nerte, [G]de[D]cir que te amo.
[D]Abre mi [A][G][A]oído, [G]hoy [D]quie[F#7][Bm]ro escucharte.
[Bm7]¡A -[A]bre [D]mis [G]o -[Em][A]jos [G]para [D]contemplarte!
